Z||000000||Coconut||11-05-2000||12:33 PM||||Hi all,<BR>Haven't been online in the past few days  due to my mother being in the Intensive care unit at the Hospital. She's supposed to be recovering from a major surgery, however there have been complications that have now put her in Critical condition status. I wish I could go into detail but it is a very long story. I am asking my Fiero Friends that do believe in the "Higher Power" if they could PLEASE say a prayer or two for my mom. By nature, she has always been a strong woman, but I can see that the pneumonia is slowly draining her strength. My brother and I are constantly talking to her, telling her she can beat this, even though we don't really know if she can hear us (she's heavily sedated because of the pain killers).<P>GTGirl and I are Keeping the Faith!<BR>Thanks for your thoughts and prayers everyone!<P><BR>Bumpy roads ahead, but we WILL get thru 'em....<P><BR><P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Coconut's_Signature_1.JPG"> ||||reg||4
