Z||000012||Coconut||11-06-2000||01:49 AM||||Just got back from the hospital this evening....<BR>Doctors say that the pnemonia caused her to have a mild heart attack since she's working so hard just to breathe.....besides her pnemonia, the doctors are closely watching her hypertension and high blood pressure, so they definately have their hands full. They are working on keeping her condition stableized. <P>Thanks for allowing me to vent...this is one of the few ways I can deal with the situation without losing my cool. I find myself singing Chamoru lullabyes to her as she lays there. I'm trying to give back to her the love and strength she gave to me and we will not give up! Keep the prayers coming all, with the Grace of God, I'm going back there in a few hours and there's gonna be a shot of NITROUS in those prayers <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">! We WILL beat this Mom!<P>Peace and Love to all, Thanks for caring and God Bless!<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Coconut's_Signature_1.JPG"> ||||reg||14
