Z||000022||Coconut||11-14-2000||01:28 PM||||Even better news today gang,<P>Mom gets moved out of intensive care tomorrow and the lab test results came back yesterday evening......THE TUMOR IS BENIGN!!!! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> YAHOOOO!!!!! <P>It's all just a matter of healing from the surgery, and a little rehabilitation and once she's out of the hospital (week or two) I can start getting back to my regular routine(hanging out with my fiero buds) <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Thanks for lending an ear gang!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Bumpy roads smoothing out, engaging CRUISE control....and Cruisin' On,  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Coconut's_Signature_1.JPG"> ||||reg||14
